{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:22af8619a03d3e9d","name":"Melee Specialist Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-22af8619a03d3e9d","title":"Melee Specialist Talent Tree","revision":19986,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:59:01Z","sha256":"d7f5de9341202f257123f1a18b46c3084633d7d139d0cb504e19dc8e6f71971c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19986","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Melee%20Specialist%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-22af8619a03d3e9d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your skill with hand-to-hand combat is unmatched, and you can wield weapons with lethal accuracy and power.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Accurate Blow"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Melee)"}," or one of the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Groups","referenceId":"reference:f1e153dd3a9e4b81"}," in which you are proficient: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons"},". When you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," with a weapon from the chosen group and the attack roll exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," by 5 or more, you deal +1 die of damage with the attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Close-Quarters Fighter"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you occupy the same square as your target or are adjacent to your target, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," rolls against that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ignore Armor"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"},", you can ignore any Armor or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonuses granted by your target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Stunning Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stunning Strike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stunning_Strike"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you damage an opponent with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," that moves the target down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", the target cannot take any Action requiring a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," on its next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Whirling Death"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Smash"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Smash"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Unrelenting Assault"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unrelenting_Assault"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You twirl your weapon around you in a blur, creating a circle of death around you. Any enemy target that begins its turn adjacent to you takes damage equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus. You must be wielding a melee weapon to be using this Talent.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
